Scope / 授權範圍

This MIT License covers only the source code written for this project
(index.html, the JavaScript code, and the scripts in tools/).

It does NOT cover:

1. Images of people and video-thumbnail material: everything in portraits/,
   portraits_orig/, src_photos/ and src_thumbs/, the image data embedded in
   portraits.js and backgrounds.js, and the screenshots, previews and icons
   made from them (screenshot.png, og.jpg, sample-*.png, compare-*.png,
   zoom-*.png, favicon*, apple-touch-icon.png). These come from the YouTube
   channel 「拆書人」 and its covers; copyright and portrait rights belong to
   their original owners. They are included only so the tool works, and no
   license to them is granted here.

2. Fonts in fonts/: licensed by their own authors under the SIL Open Font
   License 1.1 (see fonts/OFL.txt).

